OL,3,ASecret police files released in
OL,4,AHungary, 37 years after fall of
OL,5,Acommunism
OL,6,
OL,7,FHungary has opened communist-era secret
OL,8,Fpolice files to the public, in a
OL,9,Fcontroversial move the government says
OL,10,Fwill help Hungarian society heal itself
OL,11,Ffrom the traumas of 45 years of
OL,12,Fcommunist rule.
OL,14,FCritics say the move comes too late,
OL,15,Fthat the files themselves are
OL,16,Fincomplete, and that the move risks
OL,17,Fsowing division and causing unnecessary
OL,18,Fanguish to family members.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
