OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASecret police files released in
OL,4,AHungary, 37 years after fall of
OL,5,Acommunism
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe date of the opening is symbolic -
OL,8,Fon 4 November 1956 Soviet tanks rolled
OL,9,Fthrough Budapest and other cities, to
OL,10,Fcrush Hungary's short-lived revolution.
OL,12,F"I ask everyone to treat this long
OL,13,Foverdue publication of documents with
OL,14,Fdignity and humanity," Prime Minister
OL,15,FPeter Magyar told reporters at the
OL,16,Fstate archives in Budapest.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
